        "Resistance varies from ~400Ω (bright light) to ~300kΩ (darkness)",
        "Response time is typically 20-30ms for light-to-dark transition",
        "Often used in voltage divider configuration with fixed resistor"
      ],
      "usageNotes": [
        "Common uses: light detection, automatic lighting control, light meters",
        "Typical voltage divider: LDR + 10kΩ resistor",
        "Connect to analog input (ADC) to read light level"
